---
/**
 * A line of type between the repeats, in the same panel as the pitch.
 *
 * Same wrapper as IntroGlizzy — an untitled WindowPanel, so dot screen and
 * bone card — with a CTA-blue keyline instead of the dark one, and the line
 * flanked by a rule of asterisks.
 *
 * The asterisks are `aria-hidden`: they are typographic ornament, and a screen
 * reader announcing "asterisk asterisk asterisk" either side of every line is
 * noise, not content.
 *
 * There used to be a third pair BETWEEN two lines of type, and four more in the
 * card's corners. Both sets are gone, along with the second line — see below.
 * What is left is the pair of rules flanking the stack, which is the one job
 * the marks were doing that nothing else does.
 *
 * Sequoia Light rather than Magnolia — the wordmark face is the page's, and
 * these lines are asides between the repeats, not more wordmarks.
 *
 * ONE line, one default slot. There was a second — a small uppercase spec
 * stamped between hairline rules under the display line — carrying "Hot Link
 * Chain Technology" and "Fully Fungible". Those two phrases are the display
 * line itself now, and the claims they sat under ("Get in on the ground
 * level", "The currency of the future") are gone: one voice per interlude
 * rather than a claim and its own footnote in the same card.
 *
 * If a second line is ever wanted back, the trap that cost the first attempt
 * is worth knowing going in: a second BARE `<slot />` renders the DEFAULT
 * slot's content a second time rather than waiting to be filled, so it printed
 * every interlude's line twice. It has to be a NAMED slot, and guarded with
 * `Astro.slots.has` so an unfilled one is absent rather than an empty
 * paragraph taking up leading.
 */
import WindowPanel from './WindowPanel.astro';
---

<section class="interlude">
  <div class="interlude__panel">
    <WindowPanel>
      <div class="interlude__stack">
        <span class="interlude__stars f-sequoia-light" aria-hidden="true">* * *</span>
        <p class="interlude__line f-sequoia-light"><slot /></p>
        <span class="interlude__stars f-sequoia-light" aria-hidden="true">* * *</span>
      </div>
    </WindowPanel>
  </div>
</section>
